<title>USA: American Trans Air August load factor off.</title>
<headline>American Trans Air August load factor off.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>August	    August</p>
<p>			    1996		1995	    Change</p>
<p>Revenue passenger miles (000s)</p>
<p>			   1,042,794	  991,405	   5.2%</p>
<p>Available seat miles (000s)</p>
<p>			   1,387,127	1,246,049	  11.3%</p>
<p>Passenger load factor    75.2%	    79.6%     -4.4 pts</p>
<p>    Year-to-date	   1996		1995</p>
<p>Revenue passenger miles (000s)</p>
<p>			   6,832,716	6,351,705	   7.6%</p>
<p>Available seat miles (000s)</p>
<p>			   9,695,190	8,715,858	  11.2%</p>
<p>Passenger load factor     70.5%	    72.9%     -2.4 pts</p>
<p>Note: American Trans Air Inc is a subsidiary of Amtran Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
